"Command Bar Slot 10"
END

GUI:CommandSlot10Description
"Presses command bar slot 10 (column 4, middle row, 'F' in the default grid layout)."
END

GUI:CommandSlot11
"Command Bar Slot 11"
END

GUI:CommandSlot11Description
"Presses command bar slot 11 (column 5, middle row, 'G' in the default grid layout)."
