GUI:CommandSlot12
"Command Bar Slot 12"
END

GUI:CommandSlot12Description
"Presses command bar slot 12 (column 6, middle row, 'H' in the default grid layout)."
END

GUI:CommandSlot13
"Command Bar Slot 13"
END

GUI:CommandSlot13Description
"Presses command bar slot 13 (column 1, bottom row, 'Z' in the default grid layout), where Eject sits, for a unit's passengers or a building's garrison."
END

GUI:CommandSlot14
"Command Bar Slot 14"
END

GUI:CommandSlot14Description
"Presses command bar slot 14 (column 2, bottom row, 'X' in the default grid layout), where Guard sits."
END

GUI:CommandSlot15
"Command Bar Slot 15"
END

GUI:CommandSlot15Description
"Presses command bar slot 15 (column 3, bottom row, 'C' in the default grid layout), where Hold Position sits."
END

GUI:CommandSlot16
"Command Bar Slot 16"
END

GUI:CommandSlot16Description
"Presses command bar slot 16 (column 4, bottom row, 'V' in the default grid layout)."
END

GUI:CommandSlot17
"Command Bar Slot 17"
END

GUI:CommandSlot17Description
"Presses command bar slot 17 (column 5, bottom row, 'B' in the default grid layout), where a building's rally point sits."
